  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoration and requalification Old Quelimane Cathedral</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is to contribute to restauration of the old Quelimane Cathedral, which is an old historical and heritage building at risk of decay. The premises will be used for cutlure activities, tourism, and social development of youths. Citizens of Quelimane including civil society, municipal autorities, local government, the Church and diaspora have joined forces to restore the site and the building, which is source of cultural identy and self pride.</narrative>
  </description>
